<% content_for :title, "Terms · Handshake" %>
<h1>Terms, in plain words</h1>
<section class="card stack">
  <p><strong>Handshake is for adults (18+).</strong> By using it you confirm you're 18 or older.</p>
  <p>Be kind. No harassment, threats, hate, scams, spam, sexual content involving anyone without consent, or anything illegal. Don't add people to a group to gang up on someone.</p>
  <p>Don't share someone's details outside the chat without their okay.</p>
  <p>If someone breaks these rules, report them. We can stop a device from starting new chats.</p>
  <p>Handshake is a prototype offered as is. We can't promise it will always be available, and chats are meant to be temporary, so don't rely on it to keep anything.</p>
  <p class="muted small">Draft terms for the pilot. Legal review is pending before public launch.</p>
</section>
